<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', position: 'relative', fontFamily: 'Source Han Sans CN, Microsoft YaHei, sans-serif' }}>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 12, background: '#1E4FA8' }} />
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 30, left: 40, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 6, height: 34, background: '#1E4FA8' }} />
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>适用边界：方法能覆盖什么，也说清不覆盖什么</Text>
  </Box>
  <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 78, left: 60, fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8' }}>五条构造性特征决定适配范围——当前实例化与全部实验证据都落在广域巡检</Text>

  {/* 表头 */}
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 118, left: 40, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10, alignItems: 'flex-end' }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 230, padding: '8px 12px' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>场景 × 特征</Text>
    </Box>
    {[
      ['持续任务流', '↳ 滚动时域周期重规划'],
      ['供过于求 · 须取舍', '↳ 选择性执行 y = 0'],
      ['多起降点', '↳ 终点机巢 z 择优'],
      ['三维地形代价', '↳ DEM 垂直切面代价场'],
      ['机队能力受限', '↳ cap(t) 规模—能力解耦'],
    ].map((h) => (
      <Box key={h[0]} style={{ width: 180, padding: '6px 10px', background: '#E8EFF8', borderRadius: 8, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>{h[0]}</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#3D7BD9', marginTop: 3 }}>{h[1]}</Text>
      </Box>
    ))}
  </Box>

  {/* 矩阵 */}
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 196, left: 40, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}>
    {[
      ['广域基础设施巡检', ['完全适配', '完全适配', '完全适配', '完全适配', '完全适配']],
      ['应急物资派送', ['完全适配', '完全适配', '完全适配', '完全适配', '完全适配']],
      ['态势感知与目标核查', ['完全适配', '完全适配', '部分适配', '部分适配', '完全适配']],
      ['城市即时配送', ['完全适配', '较弱', '部分适配', '较弱', '部分适配']],
    ].map((row) => (
      <Box key={row[0]} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10, alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 230, padding: '8px 12px', background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 8 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>{row[0]}</Text>
        </Box>
        {row[1].map((cell, i) => (
          <Box key={i} style={{ width: 180, padding: '8px 0', borderRadius: 8, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center', background: cell === '完全适配' ? '#E8F5E9' : (cell === '部分适配' ? '#FFF8E1' : '#F0F2F5') }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, fontWeight: 'bold', color: cell === '完全适配' ? '#2E7D32' : (cell === '部分适配' ? '#B26A00' : '#8B97A8') }}>{cell}</Text>
          </Box>
        ))}
      </Box>
    ))}
  </Box>

  {/* 图例 */}
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 412, left: 40, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 18, alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>图例</Text>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 8, alignItems: 'center' }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 60, padding: '4px 0', borderRadius: 5, alignItems: 'center', background: '#E8F5E9' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 11.5, color: '#2E7D32', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>完全适配</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#4A5568' }}>可直接实例化</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 8, alignItems: 'center' }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 60, padding: '4px 0', borderRadius: 5, alignItems: 'center', background: '#FFF8E1' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 11.5, color: '#B26A00', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>部分适配</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#4A5568' }}>需调整后实例化</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 8, alignItems: 'center' }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 60, padding: '4px 0', borderRadius: 5, alignItems: 'center', background: '#F0F2F5' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 11.5, color: '#8B97A8', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>较弱</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#4A5568' }}>非本方法目标场景</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 470, left: 40, width: 1200, background: '#0E3F8C', borderRadius: 10, padding: '15px 24px' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.5, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
      诚实口径：问题模型与算法对四条线通用；但当前实例化（ASTER GDEM 三维代价场 + 8 机巢）与全部实验均在广域巡检场景，应急与感知属同构推广，尚未实例化验证。
    </Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 44, background: '#F7F9FC', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', padding: '0 40px', borderTop: '1px solid #E5E7EB' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8' }}>动态滚动的多机巢多无人机协同任务分配 · 进展汇报</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>07 / 18</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
